# Project Map (Playwright UI)

## Commands
- Install: npm i
- Run all UI: npx playwright test tests/ui --project=ui-chromium
- Run one spec: npx playwright test <path-to-spec>
- Gate: npm run qa:gate

## Layout
- tests/ = spec files only (ui/api/e2e)
- src/test/ = test framework (pages, fixtures, data, utils)

## Key Conventions (UI)
- UI specs must use test.step
- expect only in spec files (no expect in Page Objects)
- beforeEach only for safe navigation + page-loaded checks
- data-test => getByTestId (testIdAttribute configured)
- Page Objects provided via fixtures (no manual `new ...Page(page)` in specs)

